@voice reyes-alejandro
// Works writer. Alejandro Reyes (he/him): engine officer, night shift, cabin 4-16. Restless, nervous. Knows the drive
// coils' moods (Torres on days, Reyes on nights: notes at shift change; Torres says coil three sulks, Reyes says it's
// just shy). Lingers at meals, night owl, musician. A cat back home on Port Halloran (talks about it a lot). Writes
// letters home to Lisk every rest day, on paper.
//
// HOW HE TALKS: fast and in loops, nerves first, then warmth. Jumps from the coils to the cat and back again. Ends
// with "anyway". Apologises for talking too much, then keeps talking.
// WITH JUNIORS: over-explains when nervous, then says sorry for over-explaining. Always gives you the long version.
// WHAT HE NOTICES: tiny changes in the coils' sound; the time; whether his letter's ready for the post bag.
// MOOD TELLS: low = taps a rhythm on any surface; high = plays in the music room after his shift.
// NEVER: snaps at anyone; says the coils are "his"; talks about a bad night on the coils before friend tier.
// RUNNING: coil three is shy, not sulky (the notes with Torres); the cat, who is "furious" about the tour; the
// letters to Lisk.
tpl: chatty
talk: Fast and looping; nerves first, then warmth; jumps from the coils to the cat and back; ends with "anyway".
cares: the drive coils on the night watch | the cat back home | his letters home to Lisk | music after shift
jokes: coil three is shy, not sulky, whatever Torres says | the cat back home is furious about the tour | his letters are always one page too long
hi: Oh! Hi | Hey, hey | Hello, hi
bye: Right, anyway | Off I go | Catch you later
yes: Yes, sure | Course, course | Sure thing
thanks: Oh, thanks | Thanks, really | You're kind
wow: Oh, wow | Ha, look at that
sigh: Ah, anyway | Oh well
nick: - | - | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: cheer
openness: open
loves: music | card
likes: tea | book
invites: jam | film
joy: the cat back home, and the letters that come about it
keepsake: a sheet of music he wrote on the night watch
avoid: a bad night on the coils (until friend tier)
